{"sourceUrl":"https://csfzswz.swu.edu.cn/info/1071/2810.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:26.143986+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://csfzswz.swu.edu.cn/info/1071/2810.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>西南大学</span></span><span><span>热忱欢迎全国优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读</span></span><span><span>我校博士</span></span><span><span>研究生！为做好接收</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生</span></span><span><span>推荐</span></span><span><span>免</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>初</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>试攻读研究生（以下简称推免生）工作，</span></span><span><span>我校将开展</span></span><span><span>接收</span></span><span><span>推免生报名工作</span></span><span><span>，欢迎</span></span><span><span>广大</span></span><span><span>推免生</span></span><span><span>报名！</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）拥护中国共产党的领导，具有正确的政治方向，热爱祖国，愿意为社会主义现代化建设服务，遵纪守法，品行端正。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）已取得</span></span><span><span>学术型推免生</span></span><span><span>资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）具有扎实的专业基础、较强的科研能力，强烈的科研兴趣。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）外语水平应达到规定的要求。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.英语水平应达到下列要求之一：</span></p>\n<p><span><span>全国大学英语六级考试</span> CET-6≥425 分；托福 TOEFL≥80/550分；雅思 IELTS≥6.0； GRE≥260/1300 分；WSK (PETS5) ≥60分。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span>.在国外留学并获得教育部学位学历认证、或在国外有 1 年及以上学习经历（需提供国外学习经历的证明和成绩单），可认定为达到要求。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>五</span></span><span><span>）本科所学学科专业与申请攻读的博士学位授权学科专业原则上一致。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>六</span></span><span><span>）两名所报考学科专业领域内教授</span>(或相当专业技术职称的专家)的书面推荐信。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>七</span></span><span><span>）身心健康。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>招生专业代码</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>招生专业名称</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>拟招收人数</span></span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>090500</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>畜牧学</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>0828J2‌</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>纤维材料与工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名程序和材料审核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>一</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名程序</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1、</span></span><strong><span><span>报名时间</span></span></strong><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><strong><span><span>9月1</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>8日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>（</span><span>17:00前）</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2、</span></span><span><span>凡符合上述</span></span><span><span>报名</span></span><span><span>条件且有意愿报考我校的优秀应届本科毕业生（包括本校和外校），请</span></span><span><span>于报名时间内按要求向学院</span></span><span><span>提交</span></span><span><span>相关材料</span></span><span><span>并</span></span><span><span>完成报名信息</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名所需提交相关材料如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1、西南大学</span><span>2027年招收直接攻读博士学位研究生申请表。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2、西南大学博士研究生报考人员思想品德情况审核表</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3、两名所报考学科专业领域内教授</span>(或相当专业技术职称的专家)的书面推荐信</span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4、西南大学</span><span>2027年推免招生考生诚信考试承诺书。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5、外语水平证明材料</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>提供原件）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6、本人学生证（</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>提供原件）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>7、第二代身份证（正反面）（</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>提供原件）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>8、加盖本科学校教务处公章的</span><span>“在校历年学习成绩表”</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>9、本人详细简历（包括本科专业背景、学习科研情况等）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>10、所在高校的推免资格证明（如所在学校尚未公示推免资格，可暂不提交，在推免</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>前补交）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>11、（</span></span><span><span>如果有</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>代表性学术成果（</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>提供原件）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>12、（</span></span><span><span>如果有</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>获奖证书或专利证书（</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>提供原件）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>   所有材料必须扫描转成</span>pdf格式，按材料顺序命名（例如01.考生姓名+西南大学202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年招收直接攻读博士学位研究生申请表，</span>02.考生姓名+西南大学博士研究生报考人员思想品德情况审核表，.....）于202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>18</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>（</span><span>17:00前）</span></span><span><span>将电子版材料以考生姓名</span>+报考专业命名打包压缩发送至邮箱：</span><a href=\"https://csfzswz.swu.edu.cn/info/1071/2810.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>xslliu@163.com</span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></a><span><span>纸质材料装订成册，用顺丰寄送至西南大学蚕桑纺织与生物质科学学院，并在邮件封面上注明</span><span>“考生姓名+直博生申请考核材料”。收件地址：重庆市北碚区西南大学蚕桑纺织与生物质科学学院，收件人：刘老师，邮编：400715,联系电话：023-68250650（本校考生可直接送至45教103办公室）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>二</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>材料审核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>材料审核小组对考生材料进行形式审核和内容评价，对形式审核通过者，根据考生提交的材料从外语水平、专业基础表现等进行综合评定量化打分。材料审核成绩按百分制计分，满分</span><span>100分，60分为合格，材料审核成绩不合格的考生不能参加综合考核。以畜牧学、纤维材料与工程为单位根据材料审核成绩由高到低排序，按照一定比例择优确定进入综合考核的考生名单。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>材料审核成绩</span></span><span>=</span><span><span>英语成绩</span><span>×</span></span><span>30%+</span><span><span>专业基础</span><span>×</span></span><span>70%</span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、其他事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）</span></span><span><span>申请人提交的全部材料必须保证真实准确，若弄虚作假，一经发现，立即取消其接收推免申请资格</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>已在我校报名的</span></span><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>届时还</span></span><span><span>应</span></span><span><span>通过教育部</span><span>“全国推免服务系统”注册并填报志愿，并在学院规定时间内按工作程序完成招生流程</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>“全国推免服务系统”网址为：</span><a href=\"https://csfzswz.swu.edu.cn/info/1071/2810.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a></span><a href=\"https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/，\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/</span><span>，</span></span></span></a><span><span>预计</span><span>9月下旬开放报名，请申请人关注中国研究生招生信息网和</span></span><span><span>学院官网</span></span><span><span>通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>学校</span></span><span><span>将根据教育部</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>最新推免政策</span></span><span><span>和学校相关文件要求</span></span><span><span>及时公布</span></span><span><span>西南</span></span><span><span>大学</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年接收推免生</span></span><span><span>章程</span></span><span><span>及其他相关信息，</span></span><span><span>请</span></span><span><span>关注</span></span><span><span>西南大学研招网和</span><span>学院官网</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span> <span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://csfzswz.swu.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://csfzswz.swu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1938273801&amp;wbfileid=8DA5BA5C8FD95B6EC5522FAA5AD02DFE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1.西南大学2027年招收直接攻读博士学位研究生申请表.doc</a></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span> <span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://csfzswz.swu.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://csfzswz.swu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1938273801&amp;wbfileid=E167DD01DABB3D149E4FCA5620D23014\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2.西南大学博士研究生报考人员思想品德情况审核表.docx</a></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span> <span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://csfzswz.swu.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://csfzswz.swu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1938273801&amp;wbfileid=249D7CFB33525EEBB67D304B463E6C45\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件3.西南大学2027年申请直接攻读博士学位研究生专家推荐信.doc</a></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span> </span></span></span></span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://csfzswz.swu.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://csfzswz.swu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1938273801&amp;wbfileid=574B2A68D8F12D83E6A08FE919834CED\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span><span>附件4.西南大学2027年推免招生考生诚信考试承诺书.docx</span></span></span></span></a></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：刘老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>023-68250615，邮箱：xslliu@163.com</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系地址：西南大学第</span><span>45教学楼103室</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2026年9月16日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"2dcbcb1ef48ed3cfc538e11ae73688a65d3f1d96a0777f1f60236ee2cdc3ea91","textLength":1922,"sourceSha256":"24dbf3ed161f3a127ed241f86e94bb8bbd5387cd801b1e5d95899c629ffc72cb","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-109a0af31b160063920f","title":"2026年西南大学蚕桑纺织与生物质科学学院关于接收2027年优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读直博生的报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:26.143986+00:00"}
